            "review_title": "Review at Icon Burger Halong",
            "review_text": "Saad B\nBrussels, Belgium33 contributions\n1\nAn unforgettable experience for burger lovers*\nJul 2024 • Friends\nAtmosphere: The Icon Burger offers a warm and welcoming atmosphere, with modern and elegant décor. The dim lighting and comfortable seating make it a perfect place for a casual dinner with friends or family.\n\nService: The service is impeccable. The staff is attentive, friendly and knowledgeable about the menu. They are always ready to make recommendations and ensure that your experience is as enjoyable as possible.\n\nQuality of Burgers: Burgers are simply exceptional. Each burger is prepared with fresh and quality ingredients. The bread is soft and lightly grilled, the meat is juicy and cooked to perfection, and the fillings are generous and tasty. The choice of homemade sauces adds a unique and delicious touch to each burger.\n\nAccompaniments: Home fries are crispy on the outside and tender on the inside.\n\nAward: Awards are reasonable given the quality of ingredients and service. A burger with accompaniment costs between 200k and 250k, making it an excellent Value for Award.\n\nConclusion: The Icon Burger is a must for all burger lovers in Ha long and the combination of excellent food quality, impeccable service and pleasant atmosphere makes it a perfect place to enjoy a delicious burger.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten July 22, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
