            "review_text": "Steff K\n3 contributions\n2\nA pearl in Halong Bay\nSep 2023 • Family\nWow, simply WOW! After weeks traveling Asia we were graving for some other food than pho and rice. This place has been recommended to us by our Hotel as the best Burger Restaurant & Bar in town. Let me tell you: IT IS! The kitchen is lead by a European team. I had the best burger since a long time, my wife the Pasta, which was also great, our son ordered a customised double patty chicken burger! They use all fresh and highest quality ingredients, you can see, smell and taste it. We took our dinner in their cozy bar ZEBRA, which we can highly recommend as well. The biggest choice of Gin Tonics i have seen and some beautiful rare Whiskys and some fancy beers too. Super real friendly and attending Staff.\nWhat a great evening! Thank you guys, you made our day!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 24, 2023",
